WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.053 --> 00:00:05.833
- Attention, citizens of Gridiron Heights: There will be some new rules this season.

00:00:05.833 --> 00:00:08.011
First off, no taunting.

00:00:08.166 --> 00:00:09.583
- What's up, football nerds?

00:00:09.833 --> 00:00:10.895
- I got you, no cap.

00:00:10.895 --> 00:00:12.875
- Booo.
- That was one time.
- We play offense.

00:00:13.128 --> 00:00:15.166
- Also, no haunting.

00:00:15.207 --> 00:00:17.583
- Hey, man. Great job out there. You're the future of our league.

00:00:17.875 --> 00:00:18.958
- [Together:] Ahhhhh!

00:00:19.658 --> 00:00:20.658
- F--k you, ghosts.

00:00:21.043 --> 00:00:24.166
- Shouldn’t have to say this one, but no cannibalism.

00:00:24.376 --> 00:00:27.416
- WOO! WELCOME TO THE LION CAGE! HAVE DINNER OR BECOME DINNER!

00:00:27.791 --> 00:00:30.666
- None of your precious little parodies.

00:00:30.932 --> 00:00:31.932
- Ayo, this is lit!

00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:36.083
- You'll always remember the day you almost caught Patty Mahomes!

00:00:36.083 --> 00:00:37.708
- At last, my final form!

00:00:37.713 --> 00:00:39.833
And now I'm the perfect QB.

00:00:40.208 --> 00:00:44.708
- No shenanigans, no high jinks, no capers of any kind.

00:00:44.833 --> 00:00:45.833
- [Offscreen computer voice:] You must vote out the impos—

00:00:45.833 --> 00:00:46.456
- [Together:] Bears.

00:00:47.041 --> 00:00:48.333
- That child is going to die.

00:00:48.458 --> 00:00:49.250
- I knew you were down there somewhere.

00:00:49.416 --> 00:00:51.791
- Dear Mom and Dad, I'm not enjoying camp anymore.

00:00:51.791 --> 00:00:53.125
- [Together:] AHHHHH!

00:00:53.125 --> 00:00:55.583
- TEAMY IS GETTING IT TOGETHER, RAWR.

00:00:55.791 --> 00:00:57.958
- GURGLE, GURGLE. CLAM NOISES.

00:00:58.497 --> 00:01:06.208
- This year, we’re going to be calm, orderly and boring. The things people love
about football. Thank you.

00:01:06.474 --> 00:01:08.666
- Tuesdays this fall on Bleacher Report.

00:01:09.317 --> 00:01:11.458
- All right, let’s try another take where everyone applauds.

00:01:11.458 --> 00:01:12.833
- Uh, sir, we were live.

00:01:13.281 --> 00:01:15.583
- YOU CAN MAKE CARTOONS LIVE?!

00:01:15.916 --> 00:01:16.875
Oh, God.

